2.0.0

Claude Code Workflow Automation - Version 2.0.0
Released: 2025-01-13

Major Features:
- Latest Mode: Automatic branch switching based on commit timestamps
- Handles random branch names from Claude Code web
- Smart branch detection across all Claude branches
- Auto-stashing for safe branch switches
- Configurable throttling to prevent branch thrashing
- Backward compatible with v1 via sticky mode

Breaking Changes:
- None (backward compatible via sticky mode)

New Configuration Options:
- branch_tracking_mode: 'latest' | 'sticky'
- min_branch_switch_interval: <seconds>

